    <node id="&quot;LOSS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Loss is a term used in machine learning referring to the discrepancy between predictions and actual outcomes. In this context it's related to optimizing dot products during CLIP training."</data>
