    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VALUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The value vectors derived from input token embeddings, used together with queries and keys for tasks like context-aware processing in natural language understanding systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Value is a tensor that, together with query and key, determines the final output of scaled dot product attention via weighted sum."&lt;SEP&gt;"Value refers to the input values that are being attended to or processed alongside keys and queries through mechanisms such as self-attention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Value represents a numerical magnitude or score that is sought after, such as the increase in positive pairings' dot product value during CLIP training."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b51c9e3439fc588a037c55333c86c6cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5fc28e3fa1a335ecb12a2c46fcb3980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57b7f9b1883ddd19c8bacc6f13c7a23a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbe1fa761a3018b797f95e8931d7781d</data>
