    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POSITIONAL EMBEDDINGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Embeddings that capture the position of tokens in a sequence"&lt;SEP&gt;"Positional embeddings are used to capture the sequence order information within a model's architecture, especially crucial for tasks involving sequential inputs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Positional embeddings are added to the input data in transformer models to encode their positions, aiding self-attention mechanisms."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-023c8b67da94a3b9edf077fa3025ccbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db09b94e4d3bf6b9793eca0b3d3ef219&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c87cd3d29a0304bd90833bfc5ea711a5</data>
