    <node id="&quot;D&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"VARIABLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"'d' represents the dimensionality of the matrices W^q, W^k, and W^v which are crucial for understanding the size and scale of these transformation matrices."&lt;SEP&gt;"d denotes the dimensionality of the embedding vectors."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9526da303b971a977195d19a3809b3ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32e51673be16864652dbab8fc07a061e</data>
