    <node id="&quot;QUERY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 'query' is an action where the current token looks for other functions, such as adjectives."&lt;SEP&gt;"A query in a context where the change is influenced by specific values."&lt;SEP&gt;"Query is a tensor used as input to the scaled dot product attention function, affecting its computation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Query represents the input data or values being passed through certain functions for processing, including calculation of scores and weights."&lt;SEP&gt;"Query represents the projected form of an input token, denoted by Q."&lt;SEP&gt;"The subject performing actions on the key vectors during the calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A query vector derived from an input token's embedding, used for operations like retrieval or matching in information processing systems."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e5fc28e3fa1a335ecb12a2c46fcb3980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57b7f9b1883ddd19c8bacc6f13c7a23a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbe1fa761a3018b797f95e8931d7781d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe423a0387274e65441b9c527e0e5b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e821bceca23e38586c728f7eb2311c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-347ee1cddb180db47da74eed2ab0a716&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9526da303b971a977195d19a3809b3ae</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 37}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KEYS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Key vectors derived from input token embeddings, used together with queries to perform matching or correlation tasks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Keys are another component used alongside values in algorithms for sequence processing, specifically within operations like attention mechanisms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Keys are when the current token expresses its own function, like a noun. For example: 'I am key=noun'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Keys represent another projected form of input tokens, denoted by K."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-de442a5e4162d7683f6a2442131b7161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe423a0387274e65441b9c527e0e5b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9526da303b971a977195d19a3809b3ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbe1fa761a3018b797f95e8931d7781d</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 37}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VALUES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Values are components that play a role in updating embeddings through attention weights during the processing of sequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Values refer to tokens that might be used to represent some aspect of meaning or information associated with other elements in the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Values represent yet another projected form of input tokens, denoted by V."&lt;SEP&gt;"Values are the actual information that an input token uses to update its embedding."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-de442a5e4162d7683f6a2442131b7161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe423a0387274e65441b9c527e0e5b66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9526da303b971a977195d19a3809b3ae</data>
      <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 47}]</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;T&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"T represents a set of transformations or distortions applied to the input data, against which we aim to achieve invariance in the learned representations."&lt;SEP&gt;"T represents the length of the input sequence, serving as a geographical parameter in the context of embedding calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"T represents the length of the input sequence, with each position corresponding to a token from the sequence."&lt;SEP&gt;"T represents the length of the input sequence."&lt;SEP&gt;"T represents the total length of the input sequence in which values and keys are embedded."&lt;SEP&gt;"The variable T denotes the length of the input sequence, referring to geographic dimensions in processing sequential data."&lt;SEP&gt;"T signifies that there are 8 projected tokens."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-de442a5e4162d7683f6a2442131b7161&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0b14070bcd3ef6a571246548a4ac62f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9526da303b971a977195d19a3809b3ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-347ee1cddb180db47da74eed2ab0a716</data>
