      <data key="d4">6.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Recognition model is another name for the encoder stage in variational autoencoders that plays a part in the generative model's process."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-3e73d0ea822bd93892030b14ea442531</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ENCODER&quot;" target="&quot;LEARNING&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The learning of an encoder that is invariant to transformations relies on minimizing alignment loss during its training process."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-b0b14070bcd3ef6a571246548a4ac62f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GENERATIVE MODEL&quot;" target="&quot;DECODER&quot;">
      <data key="d4">5.0</data>
