      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Self-supervised Learning utilizes the concept of a good representation by relying on unlabeled data to predict missing information and supervise its own learning process."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9ae681fbd13cfbe89e3fda7d1e7f5a79</data>
