      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"In contrast to Self-supervised Learning, labeled data are abundant in NLP tasks but scarce for representation learning in Computer Vision. This highlights a significant difference between the two fields when it comes to utilizing supervised learning methods."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9ae681fbd13cfbe89e3fda7d1e7f5a79</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
