      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The concept of 'triangle' is aligned with the definition of 'class $a$', implying it fits into this category of geometric shapes."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-3c385930ab22525d66741119eb336bad</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CIRCLE&quot;" target="&quot;CLASS \(B\) &quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The concept of 'circle' aligns with the definition of 'class $b$', indicating its role in binary classification alongside triangle."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-3c385930ab22525d66741119eb336bad</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
