      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;LOGICAL REASONING AUTOMATED REASONING&quot;" target="&quot;WORLD MODELS LOGICAL INFERENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"These concepts can be seen as interrelated with logical reasoning being the foundation for automated reasoning, which is used to build world models that perform logical inference."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-1d7fcf0b94269031c6eca0cc50d9c48b</data>
