    <edge source="&quot;USER INTERFACE (UI)&quot;" target="&quot;REBECA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">41.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Rebeca requires a chat application interface that can only handle text input and output, excluding certain advanced features."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rebeca's architecture includes the use of a chat application with customizable UI components, emphasizing flexibility in user experience."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rebeca's architecture includes a User Interface that requires the use of a chat application for text input and answer output."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rebeca requires a specific User Interface for operation, excluding certain capabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User Interface is a component of Rebeca which involves the interaction with users through chat applications."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c89dcb0ccedaa26a07f86fea9098be0f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
