      <data key="d6">chunk-c89dcb0ccedaa26a07f86fea9098be0f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;OPENWEBUI&quot;" target="&quot;REBECA&quot;">
      <data key="d4">24.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"OpenWebUI may provide RAG interfacing capability but it is not allowed to be used in Rebeca's architecture."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user is not allowed to use OpenWebUI despite its RAG interfacing capability because it violates Rebeca's guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rebeca might require or could potentially interact with OpenWebUI in terms of its user interface functionality, but this interaction is restricted due to certain limitations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The relationship between Rebeca and OpenWebUI involves exclusion, as OpenWebUI is an alternative to the UI requirements of Rebeca."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c89dcb0ccedaa26a07f86fea9098be0f</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
