      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Attention weights (\(\alpha_{ij}\)) influence how values from different parts of the sequence contribute to updating a specific value during embedding computation."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-de442a5e4162d7683f6a2442131b7161</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;\(\ALPHA_{IJ}\)&quot;" target="&quot;INPUT SEQUENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The attention weights (\(\alpha_{ij}\)) are calculated based on the input sequence."</data>
