      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INPUT SEQUENCE&quot;" target="&quot;W^V&quot;">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The input sequence is transformed by \(W^v\) matrix into \(d_v\) dimensional space for use as a value in the computation."</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-de442a5e4162d7683f6a2442131b7161</data>
      <data key="d7">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;INPUT SEQUENCE&quot;" target="&quot;VALUES AND KEYS&quot;">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"The relationship between an input sequence, its values, and keys is central in operations like attention-based computations where sequences are processed."&lt;</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-de442a5e4162d7683f6a2442131b7161</data>
