      <data key="d4">12.0</data>
      <data key="d5">"Rebeca's architecture imposes limitations on using certain AI browsers introduced by organizations such as Perplexity and OpenAI, emphasizing adherence to predefined technology stack."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rebeca's guidelines explicitly exclude certain AI browsers like those introduced by Perplexity (Comet), OpenAI, and others from being used within its system, indicating a selective approach to technological integration."</data>
